# =============================================================================
# SynFlow — Docker build context exclusions (repository root context)
# Keep runtime model + SUMO XML assets; exclude secrets, frontend, tooling.
# =============================================================================

# --- Git / CI ---
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Local-only container tooling (Render uses the backend Dockerfile) ---
/docker-compose.yml
/docker-compose.yaml
/compose.yml
/compose.yaml
/entrypoint.sh
/Dockerfile
/Dockerfile.*

# --- Secrets & credentials (never in the image) ---
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*token*

# --- Dependencies / virtual environments (installed inside the image) ---
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# --- OS / editor noise ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# --- Logs / builds / coverage ---
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/dist
**/build

# --- Not needed at runtime ---
SynFlow Complete Frontend
synflow-nn.ipynb
data_generation
README.md
DEPENDENCIES.md
DEPLOYMENT.md
LICENSE

# --- Generated simulation outputs ---
**/Result
Synflow Complete Backend/matched_experiments
**/tripinfo*.xml
Synflow Complete Backend/engine/tripinfo_runtime.xml
